1
00:00:00,533 --> 00:00:03,283
(Leonard:)...are you embarrassed
to have me around your friends?

2
00:00:04,078 --> 00:00:06,918
(Penny:)Oh, my God, no.
Why would you ask that?

3
00:00:07,081 --> 00:00:10,921
(Leonard:)Well, you know, I just noticed
I haven't really met any of them.

4
00:00:11,085 --> 00:00:12,715
(Penny:)-Sure you have.
-Well, yeah, no.

5
00:00:12,879 --> 00:00:14,879
(Leonard:)I met the huge ex-boyfriend...

6
00:00:15,048 --> 00:00:20,048
...and the smaller-yet-still-larger-than-me
ex-boyfriend.

7
00:00:20,470 --> 00:00:22,100
By the way, were they here today?

8
00:00:22,263 --> 00:00:24,603
(Penny:)-Of course not.
-Why would they? Why would I ask?

9
00:00:24,766 --> 00:00:27,356
(Leonard:)Why am I rambling?
Why don't you stop me?

10
00:00:27,935 --> 00:00:31,105
Leonard, look, if you wanna meet
my friends, that would be great.

11
00:00:31,272 --> 00:00:33,812
(Penny:)I just-- You know,
I didn't want you to be bored.

12
00:00:33,983 --> 00:00:36,363
(Leonard:)I wouldn't be bored.
Why would I be bored?

13
00:00:36,527 --> 00:00:38,947
Well, because they're not
genius scientists.

14
00:00:39,405 --> 00:00:41,615
(Leonard:)Penny, I like all sorts of people.

15
00:00:41,783 --> 00:00:45,123
(Leonard:)In fact, some of my best friends
aren't geniuses.

16
00:00:45,995 --> 00:00:47,075
(Penny:)Like who?

17
00:00:50,792 --> 00:00:53,792
(Leonard:)Okay, some of my Facebook friends
aren't geniuses.

18
00:00:53,961 --> 00:00:56,501
But-- My point is,
if we're gonna be a couple...

19
00:00:56,672 --> 00:00:59,592
(Leonard:)-...I should be friends with your friends.
-Okay, great.

